    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581-a5">

                <pb facs="0632" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Annex 1 to inclosure 4 in No. 65.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Hidalgo &amp; Co. to Mr. Springer.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-11"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Herewith we hand you copy of fines imposed
                    on several of the American steamers belonging to the Ward line, of which we are
                    agents here, and as the <hi rendition="#italic">ejecutor de apremies</hi> has
                    threatened us with legal proceedings in this matter, we beg to notify you of
                    this fact, and at the same time you are requested to take the necessary steps
                    near the Government in our behalf, as customary.</p>
                <p>We are, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hidalgo &amp; Co.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
